<title>UK: Tunisia buys cargo of white sugar for August - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys cargo of white sugar for August - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought a cargo of white sugar for August shipment at $328.75 per tonne, traders said on Thursday. Details of the seller have yet to emerge. Early last month, Tunisia bought a 14,000-tonne cargo of whites, again for August shipment, at a reported price of $338.00 per tonne c &amp; f.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
